Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.56,0:21:25.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Chị Misato quyến rũ ghê luôn~
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.48,0:21:25.61,Default,,0,0,0,,♪
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.61,0:21:27.23,Default,,0,0,0,,♪
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.61,0:21:27.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Tôi cũng nghĩ vậy nhưng mà
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.23,0:21:27.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Tôi cũng nghĩ vậy nhưng mà
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.61,0:21:29.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Ở trong nhà mà vậy thì ngại lắm
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.40,0:21:31.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Chị ấy thực sự làm biếng, chẳng hề quyến rũ tí nào
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.70,0:21:32.99,Default,,0,0,0,,và thật sự luộm thuộm nữa!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.53,0:21:36.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Tôi nhìn thấy mà xấu hổ lắm luôn đó
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.62,0:21:38.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Ghen tị với cậu thật
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.58,0:21:41.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Sao vậy
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.42,0:21:44.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Đúng là Ikari còn con nít quá
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.00,0:21:46.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Thiệc á! \NSao vậy?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.71,0:21:50.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Cho cậu xem bộ dạng thật mà vốn không để người khác thấy
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.59,0:21:53.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Chẳng phải xem cậu là người nhà rồi sao
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.39,0:21:55.80,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.35,0:22:04.10,Default,,0,0,0,,♪ Fly me to the moon
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.23,0:22:08.82,Default,,0,0,0,,♪ And let me play\Namong the stars
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.07,0:22:12.95,Default,,0,0,0,,♪ Let me see\Nwhat Spring is like
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.07,0:22:16.45,Default,,0,0,0,,♪ On Jupiter and Mars
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.41,0:22:24.17,Default,,0,0,0,,♪ In other words,\Nhold my hand!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.46,0:22:32.22,Default,,0,0,0,,♪ In other words,\Ndarling, kiss me!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.76,0:22:36.59,Default,,0,0,0,,♪ Fill my heart\Nwith song
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.72,0:22:40.93,Default,,0,0,0,,♪ And let me sing\Nforevermore
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.02,0:22:45.10,Default,,0,0,0,,♪ You are all I long for
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.23,0:22:48.69,Default,,0,0,0,,♪ All I worship\Nand adore
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.61,0:22:56.61,Default,,0,0,0,,♪ In other words,\Nplease be true
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.70,0:23:04.71,Default,,0,0,0,,♪ In other words,\NI love you
